  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 4706,
      "text": "Abraham said, “Then what is your mission, O messengers?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4707,
      "text": "They said, “We have been sent to a wicked people,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4708,
      "text": "to send down upon them stones of clay,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4709,
      "text": "marked by your Lord for the transgressors.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4710,
      "text": "We brought out those believers who were there,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4711,
      "text": "but We only found in it one Muslim household[8].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4712,
      "text": "And We left there a sign[9] for those who fear the painful punishment.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4713,
      "text": "And [there is a sign in the story of] Moses when We sent him to Pharaoh with compelling proofs,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4714,
      "text": "But he and his supporters turned away, and he said about [Moses], “A magician or a madman!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4715,
      "text": "So We seized him and his soldiers and cast them into the sea while he was blameworthy[10].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4716,
      "text": "And [there is a sign in the story of] ‘Ād, when We sent against them the devastating barren wind[11].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 41,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4717,
      "text": "It spared nothing it came upon except that it reduced it to ruin and decay.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 42,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4718,
      "text": "And [there is a sign in the story of] Thamūd, when they were told, “Enjoy yourselves for a while[12].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4719,
      "text": "But they rebelled against the command of their Lord, so the thunderbolt seized them, while they were looking on.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 44,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4720,
      "text": "They could not withstand it, nor could they ward it off.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 45,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4721,
      "text": "And the people of Noah [were also destroyed] before them. They were indeed a rebellious people.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 46,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4722,
      "text": "We built the heaven with might[13], and We are indeed expanding it.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 47,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 457,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4723,
      "text": "And We spread out the earth. How well did We smooth it out[14]!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 48,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 457,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4724,
      "text": "And We have created everything in pairs[15], so that you may take heed.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 457,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4725,
      "text": "So flee to Allah[16]. Indeed, I am a clear warner to you from Him.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 50,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 457,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4726,
      "text": "And do not set up another god with Allah. Indeed, I am a clear warner to you from Him.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 51,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 457,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
